<section class="bg-bg-alt py-24 px-6 md:px-12">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-24 items-center">
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-4xl text-primary-red font-bold underline decoration-4 underline-offset-8">Gas-Roots History</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-dark font-medium">
        Founded in 2013 by Anthony "Mega" and Tasha Vallejo, our story didn't start in a fancy kitchen. It started at an Arco gas station on McKinley Avenue.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
        For four years, we built a dedicated "gas-roots" following, proving that world-class Texas BBQ could thrive in the heart of Fresno. Anthony brought his passion for authentic pit-smoking back to his native Central Valley, driven by a goal to put Fresno on the national BBQ map.
      </p>
      <a href="/about" class="inline-block bg-primary-red text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-red-700 transition-colors shadow-sm">
        Read our Full Story
      </a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="relative group">
      <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-primary-red/5 rounded-2xl blur-xl group-hover:bg-primary-red/10 transition-colors"></div>
      <img src="/images/exterior with sign.jpg" alt="The original Mega Texas BBQ" class="relative rounded-2xl shadow-xl object-cover w-full h-[400px]" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
